    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Students must complete 11 courses from Table II."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "NOTE: Every course will not be offered every semester. Students may opt for depth by selecting courses within thematic categories, or may opt for breadth by sampling broadly across those categories."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Students considering Graduate studies are strongly advised to meet regularly with the Program Director to plan their course of study to ensure sufficient breadth and depth requirements."
    },
